# ✈️ **AIR FRANCE — CLIENT & PASSENGER RULES**

---

### **📜 1. Client & Passenger Conduct**

* **1.1. Respectful Behavior**
> Keep public and private flight channels friendly. Harassment, excessive spam, or discriminatory behavior toward staff or other passengers is strictly forbidden.
> Cooperate with Air France flight staff and pilots during transit.


* **1.2. Flight Security & Safety**
> Do not board aircraft or enter restricted airport hangars while carrying active combat weapons or restricted items unless explicit clearance is given.
> Any attempt to hijack, destroy, or sabotage an Air France vehicle will result in an immediate flight ban and server staff reporting.


* **1.3. In-Flight Rules**
> Remain seated/stationed in your assigned aircraft section until arrival.
> Disconnecting or logging off mid-flight to avoid transport fees or bypass travel routes is prohibited. Sanctions can apply.



---

### **🛒 2. Services & Purchasing**

Clients can purchase individual tickets, cargo delivery through **Air France Shop** or **Air France-DG Cargo **:

* ✈️ **Passenger Tickets**
* `Economy Class Ticket` — **One-way transport to any registered public airport or allied nation**
* `Buisness Class Ticket` — **Priority boarding**

* 🔄️ **Subscriptions**
* `La Premiere Class` — **Priority boarding, direct transport, and escort to custom airports**

* 📦 **Cargo & Freight Services**
* `Classic Cargo Transport` — **Price Will be decided when server opens** *(Between 2-3 days delay)*
* `Standart Cargo Transport` — **Price Will be decided when server opens** *(Between 1-2 days delay)*
* `Express Cargo Transport` — **Price Will be decided when server opens** *(Same day)*

-# This can change depening if the cargo pilot is online or not




