### **🌍 3. WEU Nations Subscription Plan**

If you belong to a **West European Union (WEU)** member nation or a West European Union Transport Zone (WEUTZ) Member, your nation can subscribe to the Air France Monthly Pass:

Subscription Rate : **Price Will be decided when server opens**
Billing Date      : 1st of every week
Grace Period      : 98 hours


* **Client Benefits for WEU Citizens**
* **Free Standard Travel:** Full WEU members only. - Price payed via taxes of your nation
* **25% Cargo Discount:** WEUETZ only.


* **Cancellation & Refunds**
* Subscriptions can be canceled at any time prior to the 1st of the month with a **Price Will be decided when server opens** fee.



